Language data (ara.traineddata, eng.traineddata)
From @tesseract.js-data (tessdata 4.0.0_best_int LSTM)
Origin: Tesseract OCR traineddata, Apache License 2.0
https://github.com/tesseract-ocr/tessdata
https://github.com/naptha/tessdata

Files are stored *uncompressed*. Serving `.traineddata.gz` with
`Content-Encoding: gzip` makes the browser inflate once and Tesseract
inflate again, which breaks OCR. The worker is created with `gzip: false`.

These files are bundled so OCR can run same-origin without sending
user documents to a third party. They are downloaded at *app build /
install time*, not when a user opens an invoice.
